{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14060","headline":"贺李观察祷河神降雨 · 耿湋","name":"贺李观察祷河神降雨","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"质明斋祭北风微，驺驭千羣拥庙扉。\n玉帛才敷云淡淡，笙镛未撤雨霏霏。\n路边五稼添膏长，河上双旌带湿归。\n若出敬亭山下作，何人敢和谢玄晖。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"耿湋","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14060.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14060","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、古籍注评：《御选唐诗》（中文维基文库，CC BY-SA 4.0，https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/御選唐詩_(四庫全書本)）"}